# Navigation

- Use typed routes from `lib/app/router/routes/typed_routes.dart` (`.push` / `.go` on `GoRouteData`). Do not build path strings in features.
- **`push`**: drill-down, create/edit, anything that needs a Back target.
- **`go`**: auth boundaries, tab switches, deep links after gate resolves. Never `go` from a list to its own detail.
- No `Navigator.push`, `MaterialPageRoute`, or `WillPopScope` under `lib/features/`. Use `PopScope` for dirty forms (`DiscardChangesScope`).
- Detail routes that hide the bottom bar must use `$parentNavigatorKey => rootNavigatorKey` on the route class.
